# Only the static app + its question data should ship to Vercel. The browser
# fetches index.html + questions-*.json + embeddings.json + diagrams/*.png;
# nothing else is needed at runtime, so keep the Python pipeline, docs, tests,
# prototypes, generated indexes and source books out.
pipeline
docs
tests
prototypes
web
node_modules
_*.py
*.py
__pycache__
questions_embedded.json
og_pages.json
pdf_pages.json
*.pdf
*.epub
*.md
*.bat
*.toml
requirements*.txt
.prettierrc
.claude
memory
.git
